n...\n- wie das Publikum sich zusammensetzt\n- wie lange der Vortrag maximal sein darf (mit Stoppuhr)\n- wie Aufmerksam das Publikum zuh\u00f6rt\n\nIm Nachgang kannst Du dir nochmal anschauen und anh\u00f6ren, wie gut Du dich geschlagen hast.\n\nDie aktuellen R\u00e4ume sind:\n- Konferenzraum mit 3 Personen (Bewerbungsgespr\u00e4ch)\n- Seminarraum"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "ImpLandscape.png", "id": "2476178992540280", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/65398055_2476178995873613_5890563130306836643_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VR2NBFj3CT8Q7kNvwFCRbgW&_nc_oc=Adr7eyfWD0VlYyXpnenHp2t_V-DfKE96bVw_ePiI0DE1ZpWFOXaGH2rAMiItvCly3Qo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_au-lV8_0focGMdxz7ZA0YcwJ2s2HP7TYs-KOXPH-wbQ&oe=6A469187"}, {"file_name": "ImpCover.png", "id": "2401543720011882", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57575350_2401543723345215_1378399666035813534_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zumeMU0TGJgQ7kNvwGiAPV8&_nc_oc=Ado0b3uDaM28hgoI2hZ3op5-KrL_AdlnVH3RMSJDec-WBfxpj3YhF6NRqf3K4ik0t_c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af9kVoPpiwmsx57YC-20idvr68WJmhNyC40X8c21YQDwow&oe=6A4666FC"}, {"file_name": "ImpHero.png", "id": "1575384222929044", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974551_1575384226262377_3077729185527084450_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UUBeb3Vp7N4Q7kNvwG57b3-&_nc_oc=AdpbLkV_yjnMWkgGLwzkYk5fNwpBjI-C3edJTFUTBkO_joqZa0dk3T4Pcxmoaco0SU8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8_p1WGdw9TKQHB2TjNyAhpV_EtcwVv4ajBEODcXxFuRQ&oe=6A46906B"}, {"file_name": "Basic ohne Claim (3).png", "id": "1408933533196382", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974709_1408933536529715_446